  "body": "Per https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4525 a custom element constructor is required to be an HTMLElement.\r\n\r\nAlso, rather than assume another specification will make foreign namespace objects implement HTMLElement, let's instead assert that does not happen as we cannot test it.",
